        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 8478, Single Cylinder Quincy Deadbolt</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Emtek Quincy Single Cylinder Deadbolt is perfect for transitional decor. It is traditional without being too old fashioned. The square shaped brings the Single Cylinder Quincy Deadbolt into this century, but the softer lines with the beveled edge keeps it from looking too modern. The Quincy Front Door Lock will fit doors 1-3/4 inches to 3 inches thick with 2-3/4 inch or 2-3/8 inch backsets. This is a single cylinder deadbolt so the latch is thrown and retracted by a thumb turn on the interior and by a key from the exterior.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Single Cylinder:</b> The deadbolt is thrown and retracted by a key from exterior and by a thumb turn from the interior\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Quincy Single Cylinder Deadbolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Keyway: Schlage C</li>\r\n<li>Solid brass collar and rosette.</li>\r\n<li>Hardened steel bolt.</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with a extension collar for thin doors.</li>\r\n<li>Will fit standard 2-1/8\" door preparations.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Quincy Door Lock:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length: 2-1/2\" square</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Projection: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Projection: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-1/4\" to 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-10-Finish.jpg?v=1704354500\" width=\"600\" height=\"77\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
